          "relation": "supporting",
          "snippet": {
            "line": 230,
            "text": "theorem ideal_prefix_exit {h j : ℝ} (hsmall : NaturalAxisRange.Parameters h j)\n    {g a : ℝ → ℝ} {cap amplitude : ℝ}\n    (hp : PressureDatum.Admissible g a cap) (hA : 2 ≤ amplitude)\n    (hg : ∀ y ≤ 0, g y = amplitude ^ 2 * Real.exp ((1 / 5 : ℝ) * y))\n    (ha : ∀ y ≤ 0, a y = 1) :\n    ∃ δ σ : ℝ, 0 < δ ∧ 0 < σ ∧\n      ∃ d : AnalyticInputs h j σ (PressureDatum.pressure g a),\n        0 < lowerConstant d ∧ ∃ B : ℕ → ℝ, (∀ m, 1 ≤ B m) ∧\n          ∃ M > 0, ∀ Λ ≥ M, ∀ C, entranceNormalization d Λ δ ≤ C →\n            ∃ E : EntranceProfile d Λ C, Estimates d E B"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
